#13900
The War Camp (credits)~
Original area by Pax
The war camp was writen entirely from scratch
consisting of 2 stages. First stage, meant for
mid level groups, is a large opposing force to
Freehold.  Second stage contains the "Bosses"
for high level groups.  This is fairly basic
and can be placed just about anywhere.

Pax..1998
