#13901
A Narrow Road~
   You find yourself on a narrow road leading away from the hustle and bustle
of the main highway. Off in the hazed distance you make out an outcropping of
boulders and the  slow rising hills beyond.  Many wheel tracks and  iron shod
hooves have carved deep ruts making it appearent of recent and heavy traffic.
