#13903
Before The Pass~
   Towering before you are two gigantic boulders made of rough granite, if you
stare at them long enough  they begin to take an eerie shape, almost guardian
like. The road passes between these two massive formations just wide enough to
permit passage of a single wagon.  The ground starts to slope upward slightly
heading into the hills.
