#13904
A Low Pass~
   The road rises into the hills passing between large monolith like boulders.
Suddenly you hear the shrill call of a bird,  sending shivers down your spine
you begin to question the authenticity of the sound. Without success, you try
and shrug off the feeling of being watched. To the north a steep rock formation
splits this narrow road.  Heading south will take you safely out of the hills.
